# Generated by Cargo — compiled artifacts and the build cache.
/target
debug/

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored.
# `ledger` is a binary (application), and the Cargo convention is to commit
# Cargo.lock for applications so builds are reproducible. (Libraries omit it.)
# See: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC debug info
*.pdb

# Local notes / ADRs / scratch — never shared. Don't cite these in commits or PRs.
/notes/

# Local-only Claude Code automation (slash commands + hooks). Not shared by
# default; remove this line if you ever want to commit a command for the team.
/.claude/
